---
import Section from './Section.astro';
---

<Section title="Who I Am" id="who-i-am">
  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      I'm a product-focused developer with four years of hands-on engineering, grounded in a
      decade of IT leadership working with business stakeholders and operational teams. I bring
      commercial awareness to the work — and I'm comfortable moving between product, design, and
      code.
    </p>
    <p>
      I take end-to-end ownership from discovery through to production. Modern tooling — including
      AI-assisted development — helps me ship clean, value-driven features quickly, but the product
      and the user always come first.
    </p>
  </div>
</Section>

<style>
  :global(#who-i-am) {
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--bg) 0%, rgba(30, 42, 58, 0.25) 100%);
  }
</style>
